 do that. Now let’s work through where we go from here. My father is no different than any powerful man, any man with power, like a president or senator. Why do you hurt me, Michael? I’ve always been loyal to you. When they come… they come at what you love. Michael, you never told me you knew Johnny Fontane!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'You broke my heart. You broke my heart!', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'you-broke-my-heart-you-broke-my-heart', '', '', '2021-02-17 07:10:57', '2021-02-17 07:10:57', '', 0, 'https://dev-new-try.pantheonsite.io/?p=6520', 0, 'post', '', 0);
